  "details": "Randomly, my game will instantly crash with the VRChat/Unity crash screen displayed after. This would also happen to me on open beta, but not the previous live update. But now that it has been pushed to live, I'm affected by this regardless. I did check the logs every time would crash, but they don't seem to reveal anything useful. I will still post the log here but I don't think it will help much.\n\nOne thing I can say is I'm fairly certain its OSC related. Because numerous times when opening VRCFacetracking, the crash would happen immediately. It happens to me once every few hours when in an instance, and it also happens very often when switching worlds.",
